Qxe5 { The only critical move, but it allows a forced mate. } 20. Qe8+ Kd6 21. Rd1+ Kc7 22. Qd8+ Kb7 23. Rb1+ Nb3 24. Rxb3# { As a rule, so-called “positional” sacrifices are considered more difficult, and therefore more praise-worthy, than those which are based exclusively on an exact calculation of tactical possibilities. – Alexander Alekhine } 
